{
  "company_name": "MidStream Dynamics",
  "industry": "Oil & Gas Midstream",
  "use_case": "Scenario planning and business simulation for midstream pipeline operations",
  "space_title": "MidStream Dynamics - Scenario Planning & Simulation 🎯",
  "space_description": "**Scenario:** You are the VP of Strategy at MidStream Dynamics, and the board has greenlit one major capex commitment this cycle across a slate of expansion, M&A, and commodity-shock scenarios. Some of the juiciest NPV cases also carry the ugliest regulatory risk and lowest statistical confidence. Which scenario actually deserves the capital once you weight upside against probability and risk?\n\n**Questions:**\n\n1. Showcase the different visualization options with interesting aspects of the dataset (agent)\n2. What is my scenario portfolio composition by scenario type, and what is the average NPV and capex required for each? (agent)\n3. Which scenarios have NPV above the portfolio average but carry High regulatory risk or Low confidence, so I can pressure-test before committing capex? (agent)",
