  "metric_views": [
    {
      "view_name": "simulation_runs_metrics",
      "source_table": "simulation_runs",
      "dimensions": [
        {
          "name": "run_date",
          "expr": "run_date"
        },
        {
          "name": "scenario_id",
          "expr": "scenario_id"
        },
        {
          "name": "scenario_type",
          "expr": "scenario_type"
        }
      ],
      "measures": [
        {
          "name": "avg_npv_mm",
          "expr": "AVG(npv_mm)",
          "comment": "Avg NPV millions"
        },
        {
          "name": "avg_revenue_impact_mm",
          "expr": "AVG(revenue_impact_mm)",
          "comment": "Avg revenue impact millions"
        },
        {
          "name": "total_runs",
          "expr": "COUNT(DISTINCT run_id)",
          "comment": "Total simulation runs"
        },
        {
          "name": "total_capex_mm",
          "expr": "SUM(capex_required_mm)",
          "comment": "Total capex millions"
        },
        {
          "name": "total_throughput_change_percent",
          "expr": "SUM(throughput_change_pct)",
          "comment": "Total throughput change pct"
        },
        {
          "name": "total_probability_weight",
          "expr": "SUM(probability_weight)",
          "comment": "Total probability weight"
        },
        {
          "name": "max_throughput_change_percent",
          "expr": "MAX(throughput_change_pct)",
          "comment": "Maximum throughput change pct"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "view_name": "outcome_snapshots_metrics",
      "source_table": "outcome_snapshots",
      "dimensions": [
        {
          "name": "snapshot_date",
          "expr": "snapshot_date"
        },
        {
          "name": "scenario_id",
          "expr": "scenario_id"
        },
        {
          "name": "scenario_type",
          "expr": "scenario_type"
        },
        {
          "name": "confidence_level",
          "expr": "confidence_level"
        }
      ],
      "measures": [
        {
          "name": "avg_ebitda_mm",
          "expr": "AVG(projected_ebitda_mm)",
          "comment": "Avg EBITDA millions"
        },
        {
          "name": "avg_throughput_mbpd",
          "expr": "AVG(projected_throughput_mbpd)",
          "comment": "Avg throughput MBPD"
        },
        {
          "name": "avg_regulatory_risk",
          "expr": "AVG(regulatory_risk_score)",
          "comment": "Avg regulatory risk score"
        },
        {
          "name": "max_projected_ebitda_mm",
          "expr": "MAX(projected_ebitda_mm)",
          "comment": "Maximum projected ebitda mm"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports Scenario Planning & Business Simulation for a midstream operator evaluating capacity expansion, brownfield optimization, M&A, regulatory change (e.g., methane rules, tariff filings), and commodity-cycle stress (WTI swings, gas basis blowouts). Stakeholders include the CFO (risk-weighted NPV, capex pacing), VP Strategy (M&A and growth optionality), COO (operational feasibility), and Board (capital allocation). Industry context: midstream capex commitments are typically multi-year, $50MM-$2B per project, and IRR hurdle rates run 10-15% post-tax.\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- NPV = npv_mm on simulation_runs; risk-weighted via probability_weight\n- Revenue impact = revenue_impact_mm on simulation_runs\n- CapEx = capex_required_mm; project-level capital commitment\n- Throughput change % = throughput_change_pct vs. baseline operations\n- Projected EBITDA = projected_ebitda_mm on outcome_snapshots\n- Regulatory risk = regulatory_risk_score (0-100; lower is better)\n- Weighted NPV = weighted_npv_mm on scenario_kpi_monthly; primary ranking metric\n- Variance to baseline = variance_to_baseline_pct; >|10%| triggers re-plan\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - simulation_runs_metrics (source: simulation_runs) — dims: run_date, scenario_id, scenario_type; measures: avg_npv_mm, avg_revenue_impact_mm, total_runs, total_capex_mm, total_throughput_change_percent, total_probability_weight, max_throughput_change_percent.\n  - outcome_snapshots_metrics (source: outcome_snapshots) — dims: snapshot_date, scenario_id, scenario_type, confidence_level; measures: avg_ebitda_mm, avg_throughput_mbpd, avg_regulatory_risk, max_projected_ebitda_mm.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. scenario_name, probability_weight, weighted_npv_mm, variance_to_baseline_pct, confidence_level).\n- For \"distinct transactions\" / \"distinct count\" questions, query a single fact table (`simulation_runs`); do not UNION across `simulation_runs` and `outcome_snapshots`.\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Showcase the different visualization options with interesting aspects of the dataset",
    "What is my scenario portfolio composition by scenario type, and what is the average NPV and capex required for each?",
    "Which scenarios have NPV above the portfolio average but carry High regulatory risk or Low confidence, so I can pressure-test before committing capex?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How has total capex mm trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT run_date, MEASURE(total_capex_mm) AS total_capex_mm",
        "FROM {fqn}.simulation_runs_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY run_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average throughput change percent trended by month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT run_date, MEASURE(total_throughput_change_percent) AS total_throughput_change_percent",
        "FROM {fqn}.simulation_runs_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY run_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in average throughput mbpd?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', snapshot_date) AS month, MEASURE(avg_throughput_mbpd) AS avg_throughput_mbpd",
        "FROM {fqn}.outcome_snapshots_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How does projected EBITDA compare across scenarios?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT scenario_name, AVG(ebitda_mm) AS avg_ebitda_mm",
        "FROM {fqn}.scenario_results",
        "GROUP BY scenario_name",
        "ORDER BY avg_ebitda_mm DESC",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total revenue impact millions trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT run_date, SUM(revenue_impact_mm) AS total_revenue_impact_mm",
        "FROM {fqn}.simulation_runs",
        "GROUP BY run_date",
        "ORDER BY run_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total projected ebitda millions trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(projected_ebitda_mm) AS total_projected_ebitda_mm",
